  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.0: Intelligent routing and load balancing — least-connections, power-of-two-choices, weighted, and latency-aware modes; passive health checks with outlier ejection; automatic retries/failover; sticky sessions; slow start; and per-endpoint weighted canary with header routing. Observability via OpenTelemetry — metrics and traces exported over OTLP, with a turnkey Prometheus/Tempo/Loki/Grafana Docker stack",
